# Walk until a block is within mining reach. It is a skill of its own so that a
# failed search is ONE failure of the caller's rule: three failed explores
# inside this frame (the per-rule cap) fail it with not_found, and the caller
# then falls through to its next rule, see find_ore. Same shape as find_stone,
# for any block.
skill search_surface(block: block)
  doc "Explore the surface until the given block is within mining reach; fails not_found when exploring runs out."
  rules:
    near($block, 5) -> done
    true -> explore($block)
